15 0 obj
<< /A 51 0 R /Alt (Graph A displays monthly precipitation and temperature. Graph B shows relative humidity and vapor pressure deficit. Image C portrays a rocky grassland landscape. Image D features plants with long green leaves and yellow flowers. Image E displays a close-up of these plants on rocky terrain. Image F shows a yellow flower with prominent stamens. Image G highlights a plant with pointed leaves and a purple bud. Image H depicts dried vegetation, while Image I shows a plant with green and brown leaves and a purple bud.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 36 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
